---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Projects
description: PrimeTurf project case studies across Gauteng and the Western Cape.
eyebrow: Projects
heading: Recent work.
lede: Case studies from residential, estate and commercial installations.
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Projects
eleventyComputed:
  noindex: "{{ collections.caseStudies.length == 0 }}"
---
<section class="section section--flush-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.caseStudies.length %}
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for p in collections.caseStudies %}
      <li data-reveal><a class="post-card" href="{{ p.url }}"><span class="label">{{ p.data.location }}</span><h2 class="post-card__title">{{ p.data.title }}</h2><p>{{ p.data.summary }}</p><span class="svc-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p class="lede">Case studies are being prepared. In the meantime, see <a href="/#results">before &amp; after examples</a> or <a href="/visualise/">visualise your own space</a>.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
